        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<a href="/posts/2cool4school-writeup-kalmar-ctf-2023" class="inline-block text-lg font-medium text-accent decoration-dashed underline-offset-4 focus-visible:no-underline focus-visible:underline-offset-0"> <h2 style="view-transition-name:2-cool-4-school-writeup-kalmar-ctf-2023" class="text-lg font-medium decoration-dashed hover:underline">2Cool4School Writeup - Kalmar CTF 2023</h2> </a> <div class="flex items-center gap-x-2 opacity-80"> <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="inline-block size-6 min-w-[1.375rem] scale-90"><path stroke="none" d="M0 0h24v24H0z" fill="none"></path><path d="M4 7a2 2 0 0 1 2 -2h12a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v12a2 2 0 0 1 -2 2h-12a2 2 0 0 1 -2 -2v-12z"></path><path d="M16 3v4"></path><path d="M8 3v4"></path><path d="M4 11h16"></path><path d="M7 14h.013"></path><path d="M10.01 14h.005"></path><path d="M13.01 14h.005"></path><path d="M16.015 14h.005"></path><path d="M13.015 17h.005"></path><path d="M7.01 17h.005"></path><path d="M10.01 17h.005"></path></svg>  <time class="text-sm" datetime="2023-06-18T15:20:35.000Z">18 Jun, 2023</time> </div> <p>A writeup for the web challenge 2Cool4School from Kalmar CTF 2023. This writeup examines hidden APIs discovered through Swagger documentation, finding a CSRF in the profile picture upload functionality of a website, and taking advantage of an HTTP parameter injection in a faulty SSO flow.</p>]]></content>
